 }
 
 // checkCustodyRoot gates the Runtime IPC root itself: an euid-owned
-// directory, never a symlink, never writable by group or other unless
-// the sticky bit civilizes the write (a 0777 root refuses here — the
-// hole the first leaf left for this bind step). The directory is
