   790	| Durable data | <code>~/Library/Application Support/ax</code> | <code>$XDG_DATA_HOME/ax</code>, default <code>~/.local/share/ax</code> | <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\ax\data</code> |
   791	| Mutable state/index | <code>~/Library/Application Support/ax/state</code> | <code>$XDG_STATE_HOME/ax</code>, default <code>~/.local/state/ax</code> | <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\ax\state</code> |
   792	| Cache | <code>~/Library/Caches/ax</code> | <code>$XDG_CACHE_HOME/ax</code>, default <code>~/.cache/ax</code> | <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\ax\cache</code> |
   793	| Runtime IPC | per-user temporary directory with mode 0700 | <code>$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/ax</code> | per-user named pipe and process handles |
   794	
   795	The XDG variables displayed in the defaults table are inputs to platform
   796	defaults, not additional <code>AX_*</code> overrides. On Windows, path
   797	comparison MUST use a
   798	volume-aware, case-insensitive comparison unless the volume is proven
   799	case-sensitive. On Unix, paths are byte-case-sensitive after UTF-8 validation.
   800	
   801	Ax-owned config, durable-data, state, cache, staging, and runtime directories
   802	MUST be accessible only to the current user: mode 0700 directories and 0600
   803	files on Unix, or a user-only DACL on Windows. Materialized workspace entries
   804	use their manifest modes, but their staging root remains user-only until commit.
   805	
   806	On macOS the tmux backend MUST use a dedicated AX server selected by
   807	<code>tmux -S &lt;runtime&gt;/tmux/ax.sock</code>. The
   808	<code>&lt;runtime&gt;/tmux</code> parent MUST be AX-created, owned by the current
   809	user, mode 0700, and verified component-by-component without following a
   810	symlink. Before bind, connect, rename, or unlink, AX MUST reject a socket path,
   811	parent, or ancestor whose resolved identity changed or whose file kind,
   812	ownership, or permissions are unsafe. The socket is runtime IPC, never durable
   813	identity.
   814	
   815	The durable data layout is:
   816	
   817	~~~text
   818	<data>/
   819	  objects/sha256/HH/REST
   820	  records/json/sha256/HH/REST

